  "notes": [
    "D generated by bevelled extrusion of the established Bodoni Moda Medium Italic D outline; each local axis refit to [-1,1] to keep original body scale and placement contract. UV, normal, smooth normal, AO, directional occlusion and thickness are generated; no flat logo is substituted for geometry.",
    "The source font stem and bowl overlap. The watertight monogram therefore uses the existing unioned Daily Design contour from Daily-Design-ActiveTheory/src/assets/monogram-shape.json, copied locally as src/models/monogram-union-contours.json; SHA-256 c5cd2fccb2e59357aef589fef2a6527d14828294e809e94bb4a61c190e476c84. Its single counter remains open.",
    "AO uses 20 deterministic hemisphere rays per vertex; directional occlusion uses 6 cardinal rays; thickness uses inward normal ray distance. These are geometry-derived baked approximations, not Lusion original offline bake values.",
    "Seven new 8192-point surface samples replace real team portraits. Original GPU particles, mouse light, scanline, blur, glitch, transitions and point counts remain runtime-owned. faceId default must be patched from edan to daily.",
    "Original astronaut helmet/wearpack base and face images were opened and inspected. No Lusion wordmark was visible in those maps. Retain the 53-bone rig, original cloth/metal normal/roughness/albedo maps and original animation buffers.",
    "The published getCrossAoShadowIntersect still assumes 3-axis crosses; apply src/models/daily-neighbour-shadow.glsl as the function replacement for a D-shaped conservative analytic proxy, or explicitly report cross-shaped neighbour shadow/reflection approximation as unresolved."
